    <p>All Eligible Assets will, to the extent applicable, adhere to the FSI Group's specific sustainability risk policies, including those covering agricultural commodities, chemicals, energy, forestry, mining and metals, thermal coal phase out, <b>UNESCO</b> World Heritage Sites and Ramsar-designated wetlands. We also apply the Equator Principles when financing relevant projects.</p>
